	<owl:Ontology rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;cq-sample-conversation">
		<rdfs:label>CJF sample conversation CQs and answers</rdfs:label>
		<dct:abstract>Extends the team&apos;s annotated platform discussion with four selected-option agreement connections and one information-request answer transition, retaining the source individuals and evidence.</dct:abstract>
		<dct:creator>Devin De Silva</dct:creator>
		<dct:creator>Matthew Lausev</dct:creator>
		<dct:creator>Srihari Sridharan</dct:creator>
		<dct:creator>Tiziana Hernandez</dct:creator>
		<owl:imports rdf:resource="https://tw.rpi.edu/ontology-engineering/oe2026/tracking-cjf/"/>
	</owl:Ontology>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;MultipartyConversation"/>
		<prov:wasAssociatedWith rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerA"/>
		<prov:wasAssociatedWith rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB"/>
		<prov:wasAssociatedWith rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerC"/>
		<prov:wasAssociatedWith rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationIdentifier>CQ-sample conversation</tracking-cjf:hasConversationIdentifier>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerA">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Speaker"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>Speaker A</tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Speaker"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>Speaker B</tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerC">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Speaker"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>Speaker C</tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Speaker"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>Speaker D</tracking-cjf:hasSpeakerName>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn1">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerA"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>We need to choose a platform for the new development project today so we can start setting up the environment next week.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">1</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn10">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerC"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Its base subscription is $12,000 a year, so I expect Platform B would cost us less overall.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">10</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn10FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 10</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Its base subscription is $12,000 a year, so I expect Platform B would cost us less overall.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn10"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn11">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Would we have it ready in time, though? Platform B needs additional configuration, and we only have two weeks before development starts.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">11</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn11FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 11</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Would we have it ready in time, though? Platform B needs additional configuration, and we only have two weeks before development starts.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn11"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn12">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I’m not sure that cost comparison includes everything. Doesn’t Platform B require separate licenses for the deployment and identity extensions?</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">12</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn12FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 12</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I’m not sure that cost comparison includes everything. Doesn’t Platform B require separate licenses for the deployment and identity extensions?</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn12"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn13">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>It does. I put together a fuller estimate this morning. The required licenses add $8,000, and training adds another $6,000. That puts Platform B at $26,000 for the first year, compared with $24,000 for Platform A.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">13</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn13FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 13</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>It does. I put together a fuller estimate this morning. The required licenses add $8,000, and training adds another $6,000. That puts Platform B at $26,000 for the first year, compared with $24,000 for Platform A.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn13"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn14">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I’ve checked those quotes too. Platform A includes the connectors and vendor onboarding in its price, so the revised comparison actually puts Platform A lower.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">14</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn14FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 14</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I’ve checked those quotes too. Platform A includes the connectors and vendor onboarding in its price, so the revised comparison actually puts Platform A lower.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn14"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn15">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerA"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Then we could cover Platform A’s $6,000 gap by moving the funds reserved for the reporting add-on. Both platforms already include the basic reporting this project needs.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">15</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn15FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 15</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Then we could cover Platform A’s $6,000 gap by moving the funds reserved for the reporting add-on. Both platforms already include the basic reporting this project needs.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn15"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn16">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I manage that budget, and the funds are still available. I’m comfortable moving them because we haven’t committed to purchasing the add-on.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">16</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn16FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 16</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I manage that budget, and the funds are still available. I’m comfortable moving them because we haven’t committed to purchasing the add-on.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn16"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn17">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I agree with that reallocation. We can deliver the required reports without the separate add-on.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">17</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn17FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 17</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I agree with that reallocation. We can deliver the required reports without the separate add-on.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn17"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn18">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerC"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Agreed. Let’s move the $6,000 into the platform budget. We’ve all agreed to that, so the funding gap for Platform A is covered.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">18</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn18FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 18</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>Agreed. Let’s move the $6,000 into the platform budget. We’ve all agreed to that, so the funding gap for Platform A is covered.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn18"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn19">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>That settles the funding concern. I still need an answer on training, though. Having onboarding included doesn’t tell us when people can attend.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">19</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn19FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 19</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>That settles the funding concern. I still need an answer on training, though. Having onboarding included doesn’t tell us when people can attend.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn19"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn1FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 1</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>We need to choose a platform for the new development project today so we can start setting up the environment next week.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn1"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn2">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerA"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>We could use Platform A. It seems like the better fit for our delivery schedule.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">2</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn20">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerA"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>We could use Monday’s five-to-six training slot for a vendor-led session, then give developers the recording and a practice environment.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">20</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn20FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 20</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>We could use Monday’s five-to-six training slot for a vendor-led session, then give developers the recording and a practice environment.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn20"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn21">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText> I’m not sure that training arrangement will work yet. I need to check whether the release team can attend Monday from five to six and whether the vendor is available then.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">21</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn21FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 21</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText> I’m not sure that training arrangement will work yet. I need to check whether the release team can attend Monday from five to six and whether the vendor is available then.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn21"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn22">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>What does the onboarding cover? If it’s only a product overview, people could still struggle with their first deployment.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">22</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn22FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 22</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>What does the onboarding cover? If it’s only a product overview, people could still struggle with their first deployment.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn22"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn23">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerA"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>The vendor’s outline includes creating a repository, configuring a build, and deploying a sample service. We can ask them to use our project template for the walkthrough.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">23</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn23FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 23</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>The vendor’s outline includes creating a repository, configuring a build, and deploying a sample service. We can ask them to use our project template for the walkthrough.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn23"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn24">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>That outline sounds good. The outline covers the right tasks.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">24</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn24FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 24</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>That outline sounds good. The outline covers the right tasks.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn24"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn25">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerD"/>
		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>For this project, I think Platform A’s tested integrations and simpler setup make it the better fit. I support choosing Platform A.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">25</tracking-cjf:hasTurnNumber>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn25FullTextSpan">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;TextSpan"/>
		<rdfs:label>Full utterance evidence, source turn 25</rdfs:label>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>For this project, I think Platform A’s tested integrations and simpler setup make it the better fit. I support choosing Platform A.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn25"/>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn26">
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;Utterance"/>
		<prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleSpeakerB"/>
