		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>My concern is the cost. Platform A looks more expensive than we can afford with the current tooling budget.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
		<tracking-cjf:isPartOfUtterance rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleTurn5"/>
