		<prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="&tracking-cjf;CQSampleConversation"/>
		<tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>I’m also worried about training. Most of the developers haven’t used Platform A, and we haven’t allowed much time for onboarding.</tracking-cjf:hasConversationText>
